{"id":"274218083f0fecb0","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-df-zfc-desc-tree-projection.md","title":"ZFC Desc Tree Projection","display":"df-zfc-desc-tree-projection — ZFC Desc Tree Projection","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-desc-tree-projection","aliases":["58-df-zfc-desc-tree-projection","58-df-zfc-tree9-tree-projection"],"display":"df-zfc-desc-tree-projection — ZFC Desc Tree Projection","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":"Map keys must be unique","renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-desc-tree-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-desc-tree-projection</span><span>58-df-zfc-tree9-tree-projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-desc-tree-projection — ZFC Desc Tree Projection"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,T \\in V\">\\(P,T \\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega})^2\">\\(T\\subseteq(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega})^2\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\;\\forall m\\leq|s|\\;(\\langle s\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m,t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\rangle\\in T)\">\\(\\forall\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\;\\forall m\\leq|s|\\;(\\langle s\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m,t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\rangle\\in T)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcDescTreeProjection}_S \\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcDescTreeProjection}_S \\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9TreeProjection}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree9TreeProjection}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescTreeProjection}_S(P,T)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega})^2\\land\\forall\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\;\\bigl(|s|=|t|\\land\\forall m\\in|s|+1\\;(\\langle s\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m,t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\rangle\\in T)\\bigr)\\land P=\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle x\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}n,y\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}n\\rangle\\in T)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescTreeProjection}_S(P,T)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega})^2\\land\\forall\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\;\\bigl(|s|=|t|\\land\\forall m\\in|s|+1\\;(\\langle s\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m,t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\rangle\\in T)\\bigr)\\land P=\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle x\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}n,y\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}n\\rangle\\in T)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}projection\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9TreeProjection}_S(P,T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcDescTreeProjection}_S(P,T)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}projection\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9TreeProjection}_S(P,T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcDescTreeProjection}_S(P,T)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The tree predicate is expanded as closure under simultaneous initial segments before its projection is taken.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-tree9-tree-projection</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"P,T \\in V","display":false},{"tex":"T\\subseteq(\\omega^{<\\omega})^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\;\\forall m\\leq|s|\\;(\\langle s\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m,t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\rangle\\in T)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcDescTreeProjection}_S \\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTree9TreeProjection}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcDescTreeProjection}_S(P,T)\\leftrightarrow T\\subseteq(\\omega^{<\\omega})^2\\land\\forall\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in T\\;\\bigl(|s|=|t|\\land\\forall m\\in|s|+1\\;(\\langle s\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m,t\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}m\\rangle\\in T)\\bigr)\\land P=\\{x\\in\\omega^\\omega:\\exists y\\in\\omega^\\omega\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\langle x\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}n,y\\mathbin{\\upharpoonright}n\\rangle\\in T)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}desc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}projection\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTree9TreeProjection}_S(P,T)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcDescTreeProjection}_S(P,T)","display":true}],"bytes":1485,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1800","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-desc-tree-projection.md|58-df-zfc-desc-tree-projection]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":[]}